+# Shape morph
+
+## Problem
+
+The agent's voice status needs Thinking to turn into Speaking as one shape, with no swap
+or crossfade: three orbiting dots line up on the bar columns, then stretch into the live
+bars. The same motion should be reusable for other loaders, so this is a design-system
+primitive that morphs any preset into any other. Orbit → bars is the first use.
+Spec: option F's "Orbit → bars build spec" in `.dev/mockups/voice-status-split.html`.
+
+## States
+
+| State id         | When the user sees it                                  | What they can do                        |
+| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
+| `scrub`          | Review: any two presets at a chosen progress           | Pick from and to, drag or step progress |
+| `loop`           | Review: the morph running, both ways, with live shapes | Pick from and to, watch the loop        |
+| `reduced-motion` | The OS asks for reduced motion                         | See the shape swap with a still orbit   |
+| `presets`        | Review: every preset live, mini and 5×                 | Compare the shapes                      |
+
+## Flow
+
+1. The owner sets `shape`. ShapeMorph snapshots what is on screen and morphs to it.
+2. Orbit ↔ bars pass through `lineup` at the halfway point: 800ms, each half ease-in-out.
+3. The orbit keeps turning and bars keep tracking their heights during the morph, so it
+   ends on the exact frame of the live shape.
+4. When it lands, ShapeMorph writes the shape name to `settled` on the UI thread. The
+   agent VolumeMeter reads it in the same frame to swap the morph layer for its snapped
+   bars, and back.
+
+## Components
+
+`ShapeMorph` (`components/ui/shape-morph`): Skia on native, an SVG on web, sharing the
+pure shape model in `shapes.ts`. Presets: orbit, bars, ring, dot, ellipsis, plus the
+lineup keyframe. `VolumeMeter` takes `mode="think" | "live"` for the agent's side; the
+mic meter leaves it unset and is unchanged.
+
+## Open questions
+
+- Native: the Skia renderer is typechecked only; check the morph and the handoff on a
+  device before wiring it into the composer.
+- Ring → bars passes through a thick crescent. It reads as unrolling at 18px; at large
+  sizes it is less clean than orbit → bars.
+- The agent level is simulated until voice telemetry reports playback.
